    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codey's spaceship has crash-landed and he needs your help to get home! The ship's computer has all the instructions you will need in order to repair it, but Codey needs your help solving all the different challenges ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real Python to give commands to Codey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple commands like &quot;Drone.move( UP )&quot; and &quot;Drone.pickup()&quot; to make changes to the game world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve more than 15 programing problems with scaling difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use built-in editor or any IDE you prefer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early game teaches you basic programming concepts, preparing you for more complex late-game problems</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codey's spaceship has crash-landed and he needs your help to get home! The ship's computer has all the instructions you will need in order to repair it, but Codey needs your help solving all the different challenges ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real Python to give commands to Codey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple commands like &quot;Drone.move( UP )&quot; and &quot;Drone.pickup()&quot; to make changes to the game world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve more than 15 programing problems with scaling difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use built-in editor or any IDE you prefer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early game teaches you basic programming concepts, preparing you for more complex late-game problems</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Write real Python code to repair Codey's spaceship and get him home! Automate and optimize tasks as you explore the planet Codey has landed on. Improve your problem solving and coding skills step by step.",
